                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>Notes:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light'>- </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>date meaning: ratio of vendors/users that returned </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>into that</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'> particular week / divided by number of vendors/users active </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>from week before </run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='10'>that (on overall VP, or strictly in plugin)</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000'>- number of filter dimensions reduced for reliability of aggregations (1:1  match with previous sheets won&apos;t be possible on day+ scale)</run>
